---
title: Inverted AeroPress by Blue Bottle
source: https://honestcoffeeguide.com/brew-recipes/blue-bottle-inverted-aeropress/
filter: paper
---

@AeroPress 15g 200g 93°C
grind medium-fine

/invert
30g bloom
/stir -- 3 or 4 times, until all the coffee is wet
/wait
200g
/rinse -- the paper filter in the cap, while it brews
/flip -- lock the cap, push the air out, then flip onto the cup
/press ~30s -- gently, with the weight of your arms only

target 2:40
